      "body": "## What does this PR do?\n\nRequire `wandb>=0.30.0` for both the `training` and legacy `mlm` extras, preventing installers from selecting older W&B releases whose bundled `wandb-core` binaries were identified during container vulnerability investigation.\n\nUpdate the matching project dependency metadata in `uv.lock`. The resolved W&B package is 0.30.0.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Parsed `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock` and verified that both extras and their lockfile metadata require W&B >=0.30.0.\n- Verified that all resolved third-party package records match current `main`, with no missing dependency nodes.\n- `BASE_REF=main CHECK_ONLY=true SKIP_DOCS=false bash tools/autoformat.sh` passed (no changed Python files).\n- `git diff --check` against current `main` passed.\n\nFull image builds, GPU training, and a fresh container vulnerability scan were not run for this metadata change.\n",
